<hr />
<h4>Ballot Questions are available <b> <a href="https://vote.phila.gov/media/2026G_Ballot_Questions.pdf" target="_blank" rel="_blank noopener">here</a></b>.</h4>
<hr />
<h3>Note: Button numbers are displayed below in brackets: []</h3>
<h3>Governor and Lieutenant Governor – Statewide – Vote for the candidates of one party for Governor and Lieutenant Governor</h3>
<ul>
<li>JOSH SHAPIRO AND AUSTIN DAVIS (DEMOCRATIC) [101]</li>
<li>STACY GARRITY AND JASON RICHEY (REPUBLICAN) [201]</li>
<li>KEN KRAWCHUK AND JOHN THOMAS (LIBERTARIAN) [301]</li>
</ul>
<h3>Representative in Congress – 2nd District – Vote for 1</h3>
<ul>
<li>BRENDAN F BOYLE (DEMOCRATIC) [102]</li>
<li>JESSICA ARRIAGA (REPUBLICAN) [202]</li>
</ul>
<h3>Representative in Congress – 3rd District – Vote for 1</h3>
